---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-79-public-wealth-long-horizon-stewardship-intergenerational-balance-sheet-registry.json";

const assets = registry.public_asset_obligation_registers;
const lifecycles = registry.lifecycle_cost_maintenance_ledgers;
const procurementRisks = registry.procurement_dependency_contingent_risk_registers;
const balanceSheets = registry.intergenerational_balance_sheet_stewardship_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Public Wealth And Intergenerational Stewardship | FTFN" description="Eight inactive asset-obligation registers, eight lifecycle-maintenance ledgers, eight procurement-risk registers, and eight intergenerational balance-sheet ledgers.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-stewardship-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Public Wealth</div><h1 class="page-title">Capital is not stewardship, and present value is not intergenerational fairness.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 79 separates public assets, obligations, condition, capability, lifecycle cost, maintenance, procurement, vendor dependence, debt, guarantees, contingent liabilities, insurance limits, reserves, closure, distribution, future users, fiscal stress, restructuring, and restoration.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive asset registers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive lifecycle ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive procurement-risk registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive balance sheets" /><MetaPill label="0 valuations" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Assets And Obligations</div><h2>Eight public-wealth registers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/public-wealth-balance-sheet-001/">Read the public-wealth method</a></div><div class="grid">{assets.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.register_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="14 asset classes" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/stewardship/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Authority, identity, ownership, control, condition, value, restriction, encumbrance, obligations, distribution, future users, review, and receipts remain unregistered.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Lifecycle And Maintenance</div><h2>Eight whole-life ledgers contain no plan.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/lifecycle-costing-whole-life-affordability-001/">Read the lifecycle method</a></div><div class="grid">{lifecycles.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.lifecycle_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="12 lifecycle stages" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/stewardship/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.lifecycle_cost_maintenance_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Need, alternatives, capital, operation, maintenance, renewal, resilience, externalities, closure, restoration, affordability, and variance controls remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Procurement And Contingent Risk</div><h2>Eight procurement-risk registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/procurement-vendor-lockin-public-options-001/">Read the procurement method</a></div><div class="source-list">{procurementRisks.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/stewardship/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.procurement_dependency_contingent_risk_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Public options, competition, vendors, supply, lock-in, public capacity, price, debt, guarantees, liabilities, insurance, performance, failure, and review remain inactive.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.commitment_decision} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Intergenerational Balance Sheet</div><h2>Eight stewardship ledgers contain no finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/future-users-option-value-irreversibility-001/">Read the future-user method</a></div><div class="grid">{balanceSheets.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/stewardship/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.intergenerational_balance_sheet_stewardship_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Distribution, natural and cultural assets, maintenance liability, reserves, restoration funds, option value, irreversibility, stress, restructuring, and audit remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.balance_sheet_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty public-wealth state.</h2><p>The export publishes asset, obligation, lifecycle, maintenance, procurement, dependency, liability, insurance, reserve, distribution, future-user, stress, restoration, and audit controls. It contains no valuation, procurement, recognized liability, funded obligation, intergenerational finding, receipt, score, rank, or stage change.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/public-wealth-intergenerational-stewardship.json">Public wealth and stewardship JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
